ed network flows, and employ endpoint detection and response (EDR) solutions capable of flagging the malware’s characteristic behaviors. By correlating the identified IOCs with threat‑intel feeds and maintaining rigorous user education programs, organizations can significantly reduce the risk of falling prey to Lazarus Group’s AppleJeus campaign and mitigate the financial impact of cryptocurrency theft.

